ent-TP14SeaWaterCanister = sea water canister
    .desc = A canister that can contain any type of gas. This one is supposed to contain compressed sea water. It can be attached to connector ports using a wrench.
ent-TP14SeaWaterCanisterBroken = broken sea water canister
    .desc = A broken sea water canister. Not useless yet, as it can be salvaged for high quality materials.
